;華扇＠ぱ。
@M_KOJO_NASMAKE_K43(ARG)
SELECTCASE ARG
	CASE 0
		PRINTFORMW 「Am I going first? While that may be true, that doesn't mean I'm going to go easy on you.」
	CASE 9
		PRINTFORMW 「So I'm last? If you think it's going to be over quick, I'm afraid to say it's only the beginning.」
	CASEELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「Looks like you were quite enjoying that dream of yours, huh?」
ENDSELECT
PRINTL 
CALL CHARA_CUTIN(TNAME(TARGET, 1, 1), CSVNAME(TARGET), NAME:TARGET)
PRINTL 
PRINTFORMW 「Now listen. First of all, simply because you're in a dream doesn't mean you're allowed to slack off.」
PRINTFORMW 「This is truly nothing more but a vain dream of wealth and splendor.」
PRINTFORMW 「Judging you by the merits and demerits in your life is the height of arrogance.」
PRINTFORMW 「You probably already met with people trying to bring the truth to light at the cost of your mental being.」
PRINTFORMW 「But don't let it get to you. Okay? Be at ease and give the answer that fits yourself the best.」
PRINTFORMW 「There's no need to feel ashamed about being greedy. Haste makes waste, you know?」
PRINTFORMW 「So if you try to rush it, that will surely fail to reach your true self.」
PRINTFORMW 「That reminds me of what that shrine maiden once said, about the desire that makes you want to lose the desire.」
PRINTFORMW 「Trying to get rid of the desire in a hurry might as well turn into your new desire.」
PRINTFORMW 「Therefore you must certainly take your time and give an honest reply that perfectly suits yourself.」
PRINTFORMW 「Are you listening? Hey, where you've been staring this entire time?」
PRINTFORMW 「Eh? My breasts? H-Hey, stop it!」
PRINTFORMW 「...I suppose even honesty must have its limits. It looks like some corrections are necessary when it comes to you.」
PRINTFORMW 「Now listen carefully, okay?! First of all, the entire premise of questions and answers is――」
PRINTW 
LOCAL = GETCOLOR()
RESETCOLOR
CALL FADEIN(8, "　Blah blah blah...")
CALL FADEIN(8, "　　　　Blah blah blah...")
CALL FADEIN(8, "　　　　　　　Blah blah blah...")
PRINTW 
