PRINTFORMW 「As I've been saying, you're deceiving your reason and conscience, thus embracing the desire.」
PRINTFORMW 「I can't call that an honest answer.」
PRINTFORMW 「What I mean as an honest answer is neither an empty rhetoric nor a compliment.」
PRINTFORMW 「Much less so is the careless remark of desire that is obviously far-fetched and out of place.」
PRINTFORMW 「That is to say, face your inner self――」
PRINTW 
RESETCOLOR
CALL FADEIN(8, "　Blah blah blah...")
CALL FADEIN(8, "　　　　Blah blah blah...")
CALL FADEIN(8, "　　　　　　　Blah blah blah...")
PRINTW 
CALL FADEIN(8, "　Blah blah blah...")
CALL FADEIN(8, "　　　　Blah blah blah...")
CALL FADEIN(8, "　　　　　　　Blah blah blah...")
SETCOLOR LOCAL
PRINTW 
