PRINTFORMW 「You will ponder every single question in your mind, think deeply, and then give the answer you're not ashamed of.」
PRINTFORMW 「Hey! You just fell asleep, didn't you?!」
PRINTFORMW 「――Agh, jeez! This is why humans are so... Okay, listen now――」
